OL,3,GNEWSATangled dog Twiggy rescued by
OL,4,Afirefighters
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dog that got entangled in a barbed
OL,7,Fwire fence had to be rescued by
OL,8,Ffirefighters.
OL,10,FTwiggy became trapped on Thursday at
OL,11,Fabout 11:00 BST in Chatteris in
OL,12,FCambridgeshire.
OL,14,FCambridgeshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,15,Fwas called and watch commander Rob
OL,16,FEdwards from the Chatteris station said
OL,17,FTwiggy had been in pain and distress.
OL,19,F"With the help of the owner we kept
OL,20,FTwiggy calm and carefully cut the wire
OL,21,Faround her, then carried her back to
OL,22,Fthe owner's vehicle," he said.
